    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: rules S2 on test-town - the sr-objectives-march squad march with three TRIGGERS: Briefing (scenario time 5 s -> a message), Phase 2 (Reach the crossroads Achieved -> switch Hold the crossroads ON + a message; Hold starts OFF), End (Hold Achieved -> a message + EndExercise). Judge: (1) Hold is Inactive until Reach is Achieved, then Active; (2) Hold Achieved ~20 s later; (3) End fires: every objective Closed - Reach and Hold Achieved, the far line Failed (deadline 60 s), No harm Achieved (judged at the end), the composite final; ExerciseResult Phase Ended with a per-side outcome; (4) the cluster pauses (exercise.pause-on-end)."
